exports[`the email-code email > en register: one language, code in the preheader, text parity 1`] = `
"Assalamu alaikum,

Use this code to confirm your email address and finish creating your Al Ummah Now account.

Your code: 482913
It works for 15 minutes, once.

Enter it on the page where you asked for it.

Didn't ask for this? You can ignore this email: nothing changes without the code. Never share it with anyone, including people who say they are from Al Ummah Now.

—

You got this email because someone started creating an Al Ummah Now account with this address.

Visit Al Ummah Now: https://www.alummahnow.net/en"
`;

